  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"E-commerce zine is a spectrum of materials and images gathered by and while shopping online. Taking the representation of objects on e-commerce sites as its starting point this publication seeks to disseminate materials alongside their image counterparts and the interfaces that frame them. Made from materials, product images and screenshots from Papermart.com, Allweatherblueprints.com &amp; Amazon.com. Materials: spray-paint on mylar, inkjet, acrylic and enamel on tyvek, two-color risograph prints, bound with ACCO-prong fasteners."--Colophon.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"the cover as an image of the edition / the title page as an image of the cover."--Page 2 of cover.</subfield>
  </datafield>
